<html lang='ko'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>{{meta.header.kr}} / {{meta.header.en}}</title>
    <style>
      body{ font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', Arial, sans-serif;
      background:#f4f4f4;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333; line-height:1.6; }
      .container{ max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;
      border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08); } .header{
      background:{{meta.color}}; color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:30px 20px;
      border-radius:8px 8px 0 0; } .header h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;} .header
      h2{margin:8px 0 0 0;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;} .content{padding:30px
      20px;} .org-info{
      background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:6px;margin:20px 0;
      border-left:4px solid
      {{meta.color}}; } .org-info h3{ margin:10px 0;color:{{meta.color}};font-size:18px;
      } .status-badge{ display:inline-block;padding:6px 12px; background:{{meta.color}};color:#fff;border-radius:20px;
      font-size:14px;font-weight:500;margin:10px 0; } .benefits{ margin:20px
      0;background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:6px; border-left:4px solid
      #28a745; } .benefits ul{ list-style:none;padding:0;margin:10px 0; }
      .benefits li{ margin:10px
      0;padding:10px;background:#fff;border-radius:4px; border-left:3px solid
      #28a745; } .benefits li strong{ color:#28a745; } .footer{
      background:#f8f9fa;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;
      padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#6c757d;
      border-radius:0 0 8px 8px; } .highlight{ color:{{meta.color}};font-weight:600;
      } @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .container{margin:10px;border-radius:4px;} .header{padding:20px 15px;}
      .content{padding:20px 15px;} }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <!-- ─── 헤더 ─── -->
      <div class='header' style='background:{{meta.color}}'>
        <h1>{{meta.emoji}} {{meta.header.kr}}</h1>
        <h2>{{meta.header.en}}</h2>
        <p style='margin-top:18px'>
          {{meta.body.kr}}<br />
          {{meta.body.en}}
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ─── 본문 ─── -->
      <div class='content'>
        <!-- 조직 정보 -->
        <div class='org-info'>
          <strong>🏢 조직 정보 / Organization Information</strong>
          <h3>{{organization.name}}</h3>
          <div class='status-badge' style='background:{{meta.color}}'>
            {{organization.status.kr}}
            /
            {{organization.status.en}}
          </div>
        </div>

        {{#if meta.benefits.length}}
          <div class='benefits'>
            <strong>🎯 제공되는 혜택 / Available Benefits</strong>
            <ul>
              {{#each meta.benefits}}
                <li>
                  <strong>{{this.kr}}</strong><br />
                  <span style='color:#6c757d;'>{{this.en}}</span>
                </li>
              {{/each}}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div
          style='margin:25px 0;padding:20px;background:#e8f4f8;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #17a2b8;'
        >
          <p style='margin:0;'><strong>📢 안내사항:</strong></p>
          <p style='margin:8px 0 0 0;'>조직 상태 변경에 따른 권한 및 혜택이 즉시
            적용됩니다. 추가 문의사항이 있으시면 언제든 연락해 주세요.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ─── 푸터 ─── -->
      <div class='footer'>
        <p><strong>학생문화공간위원회 / Student Cultural Space Committee</strong></p>
        <p>조직 상태 변경을 알려드립니다.<br />
          We are notifying you of the organization status change.</p>
        <p>문의사항이 있으시면 언제든 연락해 주세요.<br />
          Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>